normalasm.crashscreen.new.paragraph1.line1=Do not screenshot this screen, read below!
normalasm.crashscreen.new.paragraph2.line1=Possible causes have been identified:
normalasm.crashscreen.new.paragraph3.line1=A crash report has been uploaded to the provided link, and
normalasm.crashscreen.new.paragraph3.line2=saved with this name in your crash folder:
normalasm.crashscreen.new.paragraph4.line1=If this is a modpack, report the link to the pack's author;
normalasm.crashscreen.new.paragraph4.line2=otherwise, you're encouraged to report the link to the
normalasm.crashscreen.new.paragraph4.line3=identified mod's author(s) to help them fix the issue.
normalasm.crashscreen.new.paragraph4.line4=Since FermiumASM is installed, you can continue playing.
normalasm.crashscreen.paragraph1.line1=The following mod(s) have been identified as potential causes:
normalasm.crashscreen.paragraph2.line1=Click any mod in the list to go to their website for support. A
normalasm.crashscreen.paragraph2.line2=report has been generated with this name in your crash folder.
normalasm.crashscreen.paragraph3.line1=Click the "Get link" button to open it in your browser. You're
normalasm.crashscreen.paragraph3.line2=encouraged to send this report to the mod's author to help
normalasm.crashscreen.paragraph3.line3=them fix the issue. Since FermiumASM is installed, you can keep
normalasm.crashscreen.paragraph3.line4=playing despite the crash.
