normalasm.warnscreen.new.paragraph1.line1=Minecraft did not crash, but there may still be issues such
normalasm.warnscreen.new.paragraph1.line2=as world corruption, broken features, or further crashes.
normalasm.warnscreen.new.paragraph1.line3=Possible causes have been identified:
normalasm.warnscreen.new.paragraph3.line1=If this is a modpack, report the link to the pack's author;
normalasm.warnscreen.new.paragraph3.line2=otherwise, you're encouraged to report the link to the
normalasm.warnscreen.new.paragraph3.line3=identified mod's author(s) to help them fix the issue.
normalasm.warnscreen.new.paragraph3.line4=You can keep playing but may encounter errors. This warning
normalasm.warnscreen.new.paragraph3.line5=can be disabled in Mods > FermiumASM > Config > Crashes.
